<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f5f5f5; margin:0; padding:0; }
        .container { max-width:600px; margin:30px auto; background:#fff; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; }
        .header { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6C3FE8,#A78BFA); padding:2rem; text-align:center; }
        .header h1 { color:#fff; margin:0; font-size:1.5rem; }
        .body { padding:2rem; }
        .info-row { display:flex; gap:0.8rem; margin-bottom:0.8rem; font-size:0.95rem; }
        .label { color:#888; min-width:80px; }
        .footer { background:#f9f9f9; padding:1rem 2rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.8rem; color:#aaa; }
        .btn { display:inline-block; padding:0.8rem 2rem; background:#6C3FE8; color:#fff; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; margin-top:1rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>⚡ EventHub</h1>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin:0.5rem 0 0">Confirmation de réservation</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
        <p>Bonjour <strong>{{ reservation.name }}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Votre réservation pour l'événement <strong>{{ reservation.event.title }}</strong> est confirmée !</p>

        <div style="background:#f8f7ff;border-left:4px solid #6C3FE8;border-radius:8px;padding:1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0">
            <div class="info-row"><span class="label">📅 Date :</span> <span>{{ reservation.event.date|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</span></div>
            <div class="info-row"><span class="label">📍 Lieu :</span> <span>{{ reservation.event.location }}</span></div>
            <div class="info-row"><span class="label">📧 Email :</span> <span>{{ reservation.email }}</span></div>
            <div class="info-row"><span class="label">📞 Tél :</span> <span>{{ reservation.phone }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <p style="color:#666">Merci de votre confiance. À bientôt !</p>
        <p style="color:#666">L'équipe EventHub</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        © 2026 EventHub — ISSAT Sousse
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>